{"id":"9f19ee9b463a0acf","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-automorphic-form.md","title":"Automorphic Form","display":"df-automorphic-form — Automorphic Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-automorphic-form","aliases":["58-df-automorphic-form","Automorphic Form"],"display":"df-automorphic-form — Automorphic Form","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-automorphic-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-automorphic-form</span><span>Automorphic Form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-automorphic-form — Automorphic Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,\\Gamma,\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\in V\">\\(H,\\Gamma,\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\\in H^{H\\times H}\">\\(\\cdot\\in H^{H\\times H}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^H\">\\(\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^H\\)</span> (chosen smooth and square-integrable function spaces on the quotient model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\mathscr S^{\\mathscr S}\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\mathscr S^{\\mathscr S}\\)</span> (chosen Casimir operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutomorphicForm}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{AutomorphicForm}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (relative automorphic-form predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphic\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AutomorphicForm}_S(\\phi,H,\\Gamma,\\cdot,\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot)\\land\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^H\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathscr S^{\\mathscr S}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists e\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\Gamma\\subseteq H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(e\\cdot h=h\\land h\\cdot e=h)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma\\cdot\\delta\\in\\Gamma)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma\\cdot\\delta=e\\land\\delta\\cdot\\gamma=e)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\phi\\in\\mathscr S\\cap\\mathscr L\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall h\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\phi(\\gamma\\cdot h)=\\phi(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(\\Omega(\\phi)=\\lambda\\phi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphic\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AutomorphicForm}_S(\\phi,H,\\Gamma,\\cdot,\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot)\\land\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^H\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathscr S^{\\mathscr S}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists e\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\Gamma\\subseteq H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(e\\cdot h=h\\land h\\cdot e=h)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma\\cdot\\delta\\in\\Gamma)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma\\cdot\\delta=e\\land\\delta\\cdot\\gamma=e)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\phi\\in\\mathscr S\\cap\\mathscr L\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall h\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\phi(\\gamma\\cdot h)=\\phi(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(\\Omega(\\phi)=\\lambda\\phi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom adopts a parameterized square-integrable smooth Casimir-eigenfunction convention. The group carrier, subgroup, smooth-function space, square-integrable subspace, and Casimir operator all occur in the formal signature.</li>\n<li>The former dependencies on automorphic representations and cusp forms were circular or downstream and have been removed.</li>\n<li>Whittaker: Fourier coefficients via unipotent orbits; connects to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-functions</li>\n<li>Langlands program: automorphic reps correspond to Galois reps via functoriality</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump, Automorphic Forms and Representations</li>\n<li>Gelbart, An Elementary Introduction to the Langlands Program</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (group predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,\\Gamma,\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot\\in H^{H\\times H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\mathscr S^{\\mathscr S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutomorphicForm}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphic\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{AutomorphicForm}_S(\\phi,H,\\Gamma,\\cdot,\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot)\\land\\mathscr S,\\mathscr L\\subseteq\\mathbb C^H\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathscr S^{\\mathscr S}\\\\\n&\\land\\exists e\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\Gamma\\subseteq H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(e\\cdot h=h\\land h\\cdot e=h)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma\\cdot\\delta\\in\\Gamma)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma\\cdot\\delta=e\\land\\delta\\cdot\\gamma=e)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\phi\\in\\mathscr S\\cap\\mathscr L\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall h\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\phi(\\gamma\\cdot h)=\\phi(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(\\Omega(\\phi)=\\lambda\\phi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":2218,"backlinks":[{"id":"38dd011a65e9bf42","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-automorphic-form.md|58-df-automorphic-form]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","36d7463d215be751"]}